flowchart TD
    TG[Telegram message] -->|webhook POST + secret_token| W1["Cloudflare Worker 1<br/>validate, classify, split,<br/>upload media to R2, enqueue, fast ACK"]
    W1 -.->|👀 reaction| TG
    W1 --> Q["Cloudflare Queue<br/>(128KB/message limit)"]
    Q --> W2["Cloudflare Worker 2<br/>queue consumer: forwards jobs to Cloud Run<br/>+ fetch() handler: writes status to D1"]
    W2 -->|push, HTTP POST| CR["Google Cloud Run<br/>processing orchestrator<br/>(request-based billing, scales to zero)"]

    CR -->|blog URL jobs| BLOG["Playwright render →<br/>Trafilatura + extruct (metadata)"]
    BLOG --> SUM["Gemini summarize"]
    CR -->|YouTube, X, Stack Exchange,<br/>GitHub, PDF links + files| SRC["Per-source fetchers<br/>captions, FxTwitter, official APIs, pypdf"]
    SRC --> SUM
    SUM --> REPLY[Telegram reply with summary]

    CR -->|native media, planned v4| MEDIA["pull bytes from R2"]
    CR -->|Instagram URLs, planned v4| PI["Home Raspberry Pi (planned, v4)<br/>polls for fetch jobs, outbound HTTPS<br/>logged-in browser session"]
    PI -->|uploads audio| R2[(R2)]
    R2 --> MEDIA
    MEDIA --> GROQ["Groq API (planned, v4)<br/>Whisper large-v3-turbo — ASR only"]
    GROQ -->|transcript| SUM

    SUM -->|episode| GRAPHITI["Graphiti<br/>library inside Cloud Run:<br/>entity + relationship extraction"]
    CR -->|text notes| GRAPHITI
    GRAPHITI --> GLLM["OpenAI<br/>gpt-4.1-mini + text-embedding-3-small"]
    GRAPHITI -->|Direct VPC egress, private IP| KG[("FalkorDB<br/>Docker on GCE e2-micro")]

    MC["Claude / Codex<br/>(MCP clients)"] -->|OAuth: consent + Google sign-in, owner only| MCPW["Cloudflare Worker kb-mcp<br/>MCP: search_memory, save_to_memory"]
    MCPW -->|search, X-KB-Secret| CR
    MCPW -->|save: service binding RPC| W1

    CR -.->|status updates| W2
    W2 -.->|status updates| D1[(D1)]
    W2 -.->|👌 once every job of the message is saved| TG
